WEBVTT

00:10:57.430 --> 00:11:02.430
Giussani: A lot of the current focus is on
cutting emissions by half by 2030

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:05.730
and on the way to reaching
that zero by 2050.

00:11:05.763 --> 00:11:06.930
And in the book,

00:11:06.963 --> 00:11:10.130
you write that there is danger
in that kind of thinking,

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:13.163
that we should keep
our main focus on 2050.

00:11:13.197 --> 00:11:15.063
Can you explain that?

00:11:15.063 --> 00:11:17.663
Gates: Well, the only real measure
of how well we’re doing

00:11:17.697 --> 00:11:19.330
is the green premium,

00:11:19.363 --> 00:11:20.930
because that's what determines

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:24.363
whether India and other
developing countries

00:11:24.397 --> 00:11:27.663
will choose to use
the zero emission approach in 2050.

00:11:28.697 --> 00:11:29.963
The idea, you know --

00:11:29.997 --> 00:11:32.897
If you're focusing
on short-term reductions,